            "title": "US has a 'commanding lead' in quantum computing \u2014 for now",
            "description": "<p>Quantum stocks, like Rigetti (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RGTI\">RGTI</a>), D-Wave (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/QBTS\">QBTS</a>), and IonQ (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IONQ\">IONQ</a>), have been surging.</p>\n<p>Benchmark Company managing director of equity research in semiconductors, David Williams, joins Market Domination host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> to give a rundown on quantum computing and how the US quantum space compares to China.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
